  "instructions": [
    "heat ghee or oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the onion and cook until it is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and ginger and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the chicken and cook until it is browned and cooked through, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "add the cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "stir in the lime juice and cook for another minute.",
    "add the spinach and cook until it has wilted, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "serving hot, garnished with lime wedges and chopped cilantro (if desired)."
